## Verification Plan

```bash
# 1. Crear experimento
curl -X POST http://localhost:8000/api/v2/experiments \
  -d '{"campaign_id": "camp-001", "n_plans": 2}'

# 2. Iniciar job (lanza ADK pipeline en background)
curl -X POST http://localhost:8000/api/v2/jobs/{job_id}/start

# 3. Polling de status
curl http://localhost:8000/api/v2/jobs/{job_id}
# → {"status": "running"} ... {"status": "done"}

# 4. Simular webhook Abyssale
curl -X POST http://localhost:8000/api/v2/webhooks/abyssale \
  -d '{"job_id": "...", "renders": [...]}'
```
